{"duration": 54.272, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Scott chained a pack of huskies to a sled, wind howling.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.079}, {"beat": 0, "text": "The storm ripped his coat, snow stinging his face.", "start": 3.299, "end": 5.904}, {"beat": 0, "text": "Every step felt like walking on knives.", "start": 6.124, "end": 8.061}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His crew scoffed, insisting men should pull every load.", "start": 8.481, "end": 11.315}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They whispered that dogs were useless in such cold.", "start": 11.535, "end": 13.843}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Scott heard their doubts echo across the ice.", "start": 14.063, "end": 16.293}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He ordered the dogs forward, refusing to waste any human step.", "start": 16.713, "end": 20.146}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The huskies surged forward, paws cracking the crust.", "start": 20.366, "end": 23.103}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Men watched, breath fogging, as distance shrank.", "start": 23.323, "end": 25.776}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like riding a bike to carry groceries.", "start": 26.196, "end": 28.795}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Just as a bike spares your legs, the dogs spare your muscles.", "start": 29.015, "end": 32.124}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Scott knew dogs could haul supplies, letting men conserve strength for glacier.", "start": 32.544, "end": 36.707}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Without dogs, men would trek for miles, exhausting quickly.", "start": 36.927, "end": 40.076}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The plan saved weeks of brutal hauling.", "start": 40.296, "end": 42.239}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, those dogs were abandoned, never to return to any home.", "start": 42.659, "end": 46.323}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Their bodies later lay frozen, a silent reminder of sacrifice.", "start": 46.543, "end": 50.226}, {"beat": 5, "text": "History remembers the pole, not the forgotten pups.", "start": 50.446, "end": 53.152}], "words": [{"w": "Scott", "start": 0.17, "end": 